<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.22.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.22.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.22.0 (2026-11-24): Chapter 10 deck story done. Deck 4.0.0 holds each of the 18 codes whole in one box from the single source, with one explanation balloon and one result visual per slide; 41 slides as before."""@en .

ex:TK11_Deck_10_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "03-materials/ch10/SEN0414_Ch10_ReadingWritingFiles_3e_v4_0_0.pptx built by 08-tooling/chapter_deck_build_v2_8_0.py from 08-tooling/ch10-deck/spec_v4_0_0 (examples generated from the source, visuals 4.0.0 drawn from each run, notes 4.0.0 written for the one-box code); manifest 03-materials/ch10/page/chapter_code_ch10_v1_2_0.json with the set-up of each example. 41 slides, none added. Deck 3.0.0 stays unchanged. The notes of the utf8 story and of the practice slide were corrected because they pointed to code that is no longer on the slides (the two bytes of the accent, the TypeError, mode x, the shelf trap): the first now points to slide 25, the practice note tells the reader to edit the shown programs for the third and fourth question." .
ex:TK11_Deck_10_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch10-deck/logs_v4_0_0: code check 1.2.0 (C1 list equals source, C2 one whole code box equal to source, C4 set-up plus code runs, C5 the shown code alone runs: 18 examples, 0 findings); deck standard 1.2.0 13 of 13 (a first run failed D3 on slide 6, whose result was chips only, and the reader-notes check failed four notes without a link to another slide; both repaired); overlap, reader notes, story prose, fit, layout and notes clean. The slides were viewed as a contact sheet of 22 code and part slides before and after the repair. The builder's older manifest self-check was not used (it runs code without the hidden set-up)." .
ex:ST11_Deck_10 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met: every code of chapter 10 is whole in one box on its slide, equal to the source, with the result drawn from the run. Slide and page equality (C3) is measured in ST11_Page_10." .
